- /history resolves an exact historical turn/event to its original record.
- /export exports a verifiable session package.
- /import verifies and replays an exported package.
- /status reports actual engine/task/provider state.
- /cancel cancels the actual active task/run.
- /quit exits cleanly without deleting history.

Use the command palette and keyboard navigation to make these operations
discoverable.

Never claim to have OpenCode's exact implementation. Reproduce useful
high-level workflows through Chakki's own tested implementation.

