- RPC dispatch;
- event-to-UI render;
- model first-token latency;
- history search latency;
- index rebuild time;
- RSS/memory usage;
- concurrent workers;
- process output size;
- ledger storage.

Every benchmark must identify its environment and dataset. If a target is
