20. EVENT LEDGER EXPORT / IMPORT
=======================================================================

Export:
- produce a single distributable session package;
- preserve the original ordered records;
- include schema version, session metadata, hashes, segments and referenced
  artifacts required for a complete export;
- include an integrity manifest;
- never silently omit older messages;
- report explicit omissions if an artifact cannot be exported.

Import:
- validate schema and integrity before changing active state;
- reject malformed, conflicting or tampered packages;
- preserve original event ordering and identifiers where permitted;
- use a safe import transaction;
- never overwrite another existing session silently.

Round-trip test:
export -> new storage root -> import -> replay -> compare canonical event
content, order, identifiers and integrity metadata.

Any intentional format migration must be explicit and tested.

